    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/24/PayniaQueensBladeUnlimitedLimitBreak.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230603141550\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"PayniaQueensBladeUnlimitedLimitBreak\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/24/PayniaQueensBladeUnlimitedLimitBreak.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230603141550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"892\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"PayniaQueensBladeUnlimitedLimitBreak.jpg\" data-image-key=\"PayniaQueensBladeUnlimitedLimitBreak.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>                                                                                                                          \n</p><p><b>悲伤的化身</b>\n</p><p>一位残忍的美丽战士，以伤害对手和被对手伤害为乐。\n\n</p><p>她既不追求胜利也不追求失败，痛苦是她唯一渴望的东西。\n\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/b0/20241102_160557.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241102210901\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"20241102 160557\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/b0/20241102_160557.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241102210901\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"532\" height=\"796\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"20241102 160557.jpg\" data-image-key=\"20241102_160557.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/45/Paynia_SE_Fancy_Dress_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260502235115\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Paynia SE Fancy Dress Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/45/Paynia_SE_Fancy_Dress_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-t